  "id": "secondary-emotion",
  "term": "secondary emotion",
  "definition": "A secondary emotion is an emotion that, in this source, is used as an indicator of how fully human another person is seen. Attributing fewer secondary emotions to someone reflects emotional distancing or infrahumanization.",
